# Project One Move-Between-Rooms Pseudocode

START move
RECEIVE current_room from the main game 
OUTPUT "Enter a direction: north, south, east, or west."
INPUT direction

IF direction is an available exit from current_room THEN
    SET current_room to the room in that direction
    OUTPUT "You are now in " + current_room
ELSE
    OUTPUT "You can't go that way."
    OUTPUT the available exits from current_room
END IF

RETURN current_room to the main game
END move
